# Crater CLI snapshot bundle (txtar). Regenerate: make snapshot-update (or UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1 go test ./test/snapshots/...)
-- en/01-account-help/argv --
crater account --help
-- en/01-account-help/exit --
0
-- en/01-account-help/stdout --
View accounts, inspect the current account/queue, and switch the account used by subsequent commands.

Usage:
  crater account [flags]
  crater account [command]

Available Commands:
  billing     View account billing
  current     Show the current account/queue
  get         Get an account
  ls          List accounts
  members     List account members
  use         Switch the current account/queue
  users-out   List users outside an account

Global Flags:
  -h, --help             Help for crater
      --json             Output in raw JSON format
      --no-interactive   Disable interactive prompts

Use "crater account [command] --help" for more information about a command.
-- en/01-account-help/stderr --
-- en/02-current-help/argv --
crater account current --help
-- en/02-current-help/exit --
0
-- en/02-current-help/stdout --
Query the active platform for the current account/queue and account role.

Usage:
  crater account current [flags]

Global Flags:
  -h, --help             Help for crater
      --json             Output in raw JSON format
      --no-interactive   Disable interactive prompts
-- en/02-current-help/stderr --
-- en/03-use-help/argv --
crater account use --help
-- en/03-use-help/exit --
0
-- en/03-use-help/stdout --
Switch to an account/queue by its exact name from account ls and save credentials for subsequent commands.

Usage:
  crater account use <name> [flags]

Global Flags:
  -h, --help             Help for crater
      --json             Output in raw JSON format
      --no-interactive   Disable interactive prompts
-- en/03-use-help/stderr --
